 const response = await MyAPI.getData(someId);\n    // ...\n  }\n  fetchData();\n}, [someId]); // Or [] if effect doesn't need props or state\n\nLearn more about data fetching with Hooks: https://reactjs.org/link/hooks-data-fetching","ArrowFunctionExpression","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'tawkToKey' and 'tawkToPropertyId'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. Outer scope values like 'ENV' aren't valid dependencies because mutating them doesn't re-render the component.","ArrayExpression",["869"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'handleMetamaskStatus'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["870"],"no-redeclare","'BigInt' is already defined.","Block","redeclared","no-unused-vars","'setCollections' is assigned a value but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","'source' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'getPopularCollections' and 'props'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["871"],"no-use-before-define","'finalCollectionListing' was used before it was defined.","usedBeforeDefined","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props'. Either include it or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["872"],["873"],"import/no-anonymous-default-export","Unexpected default export of anonymous function","ExportDefaultDeclaration","no-dupe-keys","Duplicate key 'featuredItems'.","ObjectExpression","unexpected","'Explore' is defined but never used.","'Link' is defined but never used.","'Accordion' is defined but never used.","'Dropdown' is defined but never used.","'Select' is d